ram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. use-case diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. activity diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 73\u12289? A. use-case modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. class modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. dynamic modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. behavioral modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 74\u12289? A. use-case modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. Glass modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. dynamic modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. behavioral modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 75\u12289? A. activity diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. component diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. sequence diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. state diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \u31572?\u26696?:\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 1\u12289?C\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 [\u-30237?\u26512?] \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?\u26412?\u-26472?\u-32765?\u26597?\u-29791?\u31639?\u26426?\u22522?\u26412?\u24037?\u20316?\u21407?\u29702?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?CPU\u20013?\u30340?\u31243?\u24207?\u-29791?\u25968?\u22120?PC\u29992?\u20110?\u20445?\u23384?\u-30335?\u25191?\u-30644?\u30340?\u25351?\u20196?\u30340?\u22320?\u22336?\u-244?IR\u-29761?\u-27154?\u20869?\u23384?\u26102?\u-244?\u-26880?\u20808?\u23558?\u20869?\u23384?\u22320?\u22336?\u-28671?\u20837?\u23384?\u20648?\u22120?\u22320?\u22336?\u23492?\u23384?\u22120?MAR\u20013?\u-244?\u21521?\u20869?\u23384?\u20889?\u20837?\u25968?\u25454?\u26102?\u-244?\u24453?\u20889?\u20837?\u30340?\u25968?\u25454?\u-30335?\u20808?\u25918?\u20837?\u25968?\u25454?\u23492?\u23384?\u22120?MDR\u12290?\u31243?\u24207?\u20013?\u30340?\u25351?\u20196?\u19968?\u-32212?\u25918?\u22312